This application (rclone-backup) is a personal tool used exclusively by its owner for backing up and synchronizing files via the Google Drive API.
Data Collection: This application does not collect, store, or share any personal data of third-party users. The application only accesses the Google Drive of the authorized user strictly to perform file backup operations.\
Data Sharing: No data is shared with third parties. Authorization tokens are stored locally on the user's device.

